WEBVTT

00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:02.036
And the old man's answer, he says,

00:13:02.076 --> 00:13:05.516
shames him even now,
as he recalls it across the decades.

00:13:06.596 --> 00:13:09.276
"I am," said the old man,

00:13:10.316 --> 00:13:11.676
"a musician."

00:13:11.676 --> 00:13:17.996
(Music: "Adagio in G Minor")